# Written by `pnpm release` while it reads the changeset plan, and deleted immediately.
# Ignored as a backstop: the release commit stages with `git add -A`, so a stray copy would
# otherwise be committed.
changeset-status.tmp.json

# The GitHub Copilot variant of the impeccable skill. The Claude Code copy under
# `.claude/skills/` is the one this repo drives the skill through; committing both
# would vendor ~7MB of near-identical trees that then drift apart independently.
# Track these too if anyone starts working this repo through Copilot — the install
# is only functional with all three.
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.github/skills/

# Impeccable run artifacts — decision-page payloads and review screenshots are per-run
# output, not work product. `.impeccable/critique/` is deliberately tracked: it is the
# scored baseline later runs compare against.
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/review/
